    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of Teravit, a sandbox game created by players!<br>Teravit is a sandbox game that allows players to create their own worlds and share them with other players, creating infinite play possibilites.<br>Obstacle courses, PvP, races, and monster hunts, Teravit has a variety of exciting game modes to play to your heart's content!<br><br><strong>Teravit has 3 major features.</strong><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Create\u3011</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Shape the world however you imagine!</strong><br>You can choose from over 250 different biomes, change island sizes, turn buildings on and off, and more, to create a fully customized world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/af04a04e37571eabee712f06cb70ec9a.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/af04a04e37571eabee712f06cb70ec9a.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/af04a04e37571eabee712f06cb70ec9a.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Using over a hundred types of blocks, you can create all kinds of worlds of all sizes!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/7c874db8f225f0a8105397c55792b5fe.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/7c874db8f225f0a8105397c55792b5fe.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/7c874db8f225f0a8105397c55792b5fe.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Simple build for anyone!</strong><br>By placing blocks with simple mechanics, anyone can easily create a world that is both playful and visually pleasing.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/6010473efa90172456d4a33bbb41210e.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/6010473efa90172456d4a33bbb41210e.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/6010473efa90172456d4a33bbb41210e.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Play in your created world!</strong><br>&quot;You can set different game rules in your created world.<br>With a single click, you can also change the world's environment, such as the weather and background music, allowing you to freely create the game you envisioned.&quot;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/9df21ba94694826fa40235bad2873f08.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/9df21ba94694826fa40235bad2873f08.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/9df21ba94694826fa40235bad2873f08.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Play\u3011</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Enjoy fun and unique original avatars!</strong><br>Using a combination of avatar customization parts, you can create your own unique character!<br>Also, by using MagicaVoxel to create original avatars, you can upload them to the in-game shop for other players to purchase your creation.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/65a6c9815c33159b53cb7026d7d02eff.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/65a6c9815c33159b53cb7026d7d02eff.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/65a6c9815c33159b53cb7026d7d02eff.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Packed full of action!</strong><br>In addition to a variety of weapons, including swords and bows. &quot;Teravit&quot; also offers unique transportation, such as a &quot;Paraglider&quot; which allows you to glide through the air, and a &quot;Hookshot&quot; to fly anywhere you want.<br>Explore the world by using all kinds of weapons and items!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/ca24aaff49da81a02e10dd6a27a2a598.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/ca24aaff49da81a02e10dd6a27a2a598.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/ca24aaff49da81a02e10dd6a27a2a598.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/795e6296b911fc05573bc73692b549c9.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/795e6296b911fc05573bc73692b549c9.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/795e6296b911fc05573bc73692b549c9.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/9613e8ece26758b469d3fa1342faae6b.poster.avif?t=1698891430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/9613e8ece26758b469d3fa1342faae6b.webm?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/9613e8ece26758b469d3fa1342faae6b.mp4?t=1698891430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Share\u3011</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Once you create it, share it!</strong><br>Once your world is complete, upload it and let other players around the world enjoy it. Uploaded worlds can also be played with other players in multiplayer.<br>Playing other players' worlds are also available.<br>Whether you enjoy building with friends, having adventures, or competing for high scores, the world of &quot;Teravit&quot; offers endless opportunities for fun.<br><br></li><li><strong>Create to Earn!</strong><br>In worlds you have uploaded, you can sell items and avatars you have created to make the world more fun and immersive. Original avatars can also be sold in the in-game store.<br>When an item is purchased by another player, points are awarded to the creator based on the amount of the purchase.<br>Points can be exchanged for money or in-game currency on a dedicated website.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743650/extras/60b4e787cfb4950a5b75780d3dd44